    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area Approx. 100sq m / 1076 sq ft \nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present Number 62 Collegefort to the market for sale. This spacious three-bedroom duplex apartment offers a superb opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike.\n\nThe accommodation is laid out over two levels and is both bright and well proportioned. Accommodation briefly comprises an inviting entrance hall, a generous living room with access to the spacious balcony overlooking the communal gardens, and a fully fitted kitchen/dining area. A guest w.c. completes this level.\n\n Upstairs there are three well-appointed bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom benefiting from an en-suite bathroom. Two further bedrooms and a main family bathroom complete the internal accommodation.\nOutside, the property enjoys a private balcony with views over the well-maintained communal gardens, providing an ideal space to relax and unwind.\n\n Viewing is highly recommended!\n\nThe location is second to none, offering a wide range of amenities to suit every lifestyle. Castleknock Village, home to an array of shops, cafés, and restaurants, is just a short stroll away, providing a vibrant community atmosphere. For those who enjoy the outdoors, the Phoenix Park is located just 500 metres from the property. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is also close by, offering extensive retail and dining options. Commuters are well catered for with excellent transport links, including multiple bus routes and Castleknock Train Station, providing swift and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.77m (18'11\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nwith high-quality wood-effect laminate flooring, recessed lighting, alarm panel, understairs storage, coving and cornicing detail\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.77m (18'11\") x 2.56m (8'5\")\nWith tiled floor, fully fitted kitchen and breakfast bar, dishwasher, washing machine, integrated oven and hob, fridge freezer, large window offering plenty of natural light, contemporary black brushed chrome fittings and light switch\n\nLiving Room - 4.8m (15'9\") x 4.56m (15'0\")\nWith high quality wood effect laminate flooring, bespoke entertainment unit and shelving, feature fireplace with electric insert, coving and cornicing detail, access to private balcony\n\nGuest W.C - 1.88m (6'2\") x 0.78m (2'7\")\nWith tiled floor, w.c, wash hand basin, extractor fan\n\nLanding - 4.11m (13'6\") x 2.09m (6'10\")\nFlooring laid in carpet, hotpress, attic with Stira access\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.31m (10'10\") x 4.56m (15'0\")\nWith high quality wood effect laminate, fitted wardrobes, recessed lighting, overlooking communal area\n\nEnsuite - 1.33m (4'4\") x 2.37m (7'9\")\nFully tiled, w.c, wash hand basin, walk in shower, heated towel rail, recessed lighting, extractor fan\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.05m (10'0\") x 2.16m (7'1\")\nWith high quality wood effect laminate, fitted wardrobes, recessed lighting\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.57m (15'0\") x 2.3m (7'7\")\nWith high quality wood effect flooring, fitted wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 1.68m (5'6\") x 2.22m (7'3\")\nFully tiled, w.c, wash hand basin, bath with shower attachment, heated towel rail, recessed lighting\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
