        "Content": "<ul><li> Three Bed Three Bath Duplex Apartment </li><li> Owner Occupied </li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating </li><li> Management Fee 2,500 </li><li> Year of Construction 2002 </li><li> Walking Distance to Castleknock Village </li><li> Ample parking for Residents & Visitor Parking Available </li><li> Private Balcony Overlooking Communal Gardens</li></ul>"
